        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Wilfrid Brambell, Harry H. Corbett, Paul McCartney\n- Films: Steptoe and Son Ride Again, A Hard Day's Night, Some Will, Some Won't\n- Roles: Henry Russell, Paul McCartney's fictional grandfather\n- Topics: cameo performances, starring roles\n\nFacts:\n- Wilfrid Brambell and Harry H. Corbett starred in the film \"Steptoe and Son Ride Again.\"\n- Wilfrid Brambell appeared alongside the Beatles in the film \"A Hard Day's Night\" and played Paul McCartney's fictional grandfather.\n- Wilfrid Brambell made a cameo appearance in \"Some Will, Some Won't\" as Henry Russell.\n- In \"Some Will, Some Won't,\" Henry Russell leaves four family members £150,000 in his will on the condition that they complete bizarre tasks he set for them.",
